$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0>NashaBoo" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0>a bit cold and a bit Snowy." @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0>Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @  
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing :<f0> NashaBoo was lost to the Diamond Sword. But at an early age Alucard, native of NashaBoo swears he will get it backfrom the Diamond Sword. But the <vServer::teamName0> and the <vServer::teamName1> are fighting for control. Alucard with aid of Angels of Armageddon will sit back and watch to see who falls Thus attacking the victor and Alucard won't stop till he gets his planet back for his people" @
         "\n\n<f1> Map Concept by: <f0> Lord Alucard" @
         "\n\n<f1> Map Constructed and Tweaked by: <f0> Lord Alucard" @
         "\n\n<f1> Story Line: <f0> Lord Alucard" @
         "\n\n<f1> Contact: <f0> Lord Alucard via email, alucard_007@msn.com \ ICQ UIN # 21115755 \ WEBPAGE ADDRESS http://members.xoom.com/tribes000/home/enter.html" @
         "\n\n<f1> Special Thanks: <f0> To Kain and Darklord for helping me test this map through and through... Special Thanks to Goldberg over at X-fab Maps (http://www.planetstarsiege.com/xfab) for the fine tutorial he sent me and his verbal help in explaining the shit to me.. And Last but not least My Wife Suzy who put up with alot of my endless hours outta bed and the countless hours that she made me dinner and handed to me when i was sitting here learning. All Hail Suzy for her dedication to a bum of a husband, ROCK ON SUZY! I love you through and through sweety hugs and kisses.. Love yours Truely Lord Alucard... oh and one last special thanks goes out to the one the only Spider Man (yes the comic character just cause he kicks all kinds of ass)";